<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-RUSSIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIAN CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
